{
  "info": {
    "name": "Kasir Product History API Collection - Availability Product View (Task 2)",
    "description": "Complete API collection untuk Product History endpoint yang mendukung Availability Product View feature. Endpoint ini menyediakan transaction history untuk specific product size dengan date-aware inventory management dan caching optimization.\n\n🆕 AVAILABILITY PRODUCT VIEW ARCHITECTURE:\n• Date-aware inventory: Stock deduction hanya saat pickup, bukan saat transaction creation\n• Transaction history display: Show existing bookings untuk informed decision making\n• Status filtering: Hanya tampilkan 'active' dan 'diambil' transactions\n• Performance optimization: 5-minute caching per product size\n• Real-time availability checking dengan date range overlap detection\n\n🔗 DEPENDENCIES & EXECUTION ORDER:\n1. Setup: Login → Get session token\n2. Prerequisites: Create Product dengan sizes → Get productSizeId\n3. History Testing: Test various query parameters dan scenarios\n4. Caching: Test cache behavior dan performance\n5. Error Scenarios: Test validation dan error handling\n\n📋 REQUIRED VARIABLES:\n- base_url: http://localhost:3000\n- clerk_session_token: From browser cookies\n- productSizeId: ID dari product size untuk testing\n\n⚡ PERFORMANCE TARGETS:\n- Response Time: <500ms dengan cache hit\n- Cache TTL: 5 minutes per product size\n- API SLA: <2s untuk fresh data requests\n- Concurrent requests: Handle multiple availability checks\n\n📚 Full documentation: .kiro/specs/availability-product-view/requirements.md | .kiro/specs/availability-product-view/design.md",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "cookie",
    "cookie": [
      {
        "key": "__session",
        "value": "{{clerk_session_token}}",
        "description": "Clerk session token dari browser"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000",
      "description": "Base URL aplikasi"
    },
    {
      "key": "productSizeId",
      "value": "",
      "description": "ID product size untuk testing history endpoint"
    },
    {
      "key": "clerk_session_token",
      "value": "",
      "description": "Session token dari Clerk authentication"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Product History - Basic Scenarios",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Product History - Default Parameters",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/kasir/transaksi/product-history?productSizeId={{productSizeId}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "kasir", "transaksi", "product-history"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "productSizeId",
                  "value": "{{productSizeId}}",
                  "description": "REQUIRED: ID dari product size yang ingin dilihat historynya"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Mendapatkan transaction history untuk specific product size dengan default parameters.\n\n🔧 DEFAULT BEHAVIOR:\n• statuses: ['active', 'diambil'] (hanya status yang relevan)\n• limit: 50 transactions\n• sortBy: 'date_proximity' (closest to current date first)\n• Caching: 5-minute TTL per product size\n\n📋 EXPECTED RESPONSE:\n• success: true\n• data: Array of transaction history\n• cached: boolean (true jika dari cache)\n• metadata: Query parameters dan cache info"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Success Response - Default",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/kasir/transaksi/product-history?productSizeId=size-uuid-1",
                  "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "kasir", "transaksi", "product-history"],
                  "query": [
                    {
                      "key": "productSizeId",
                      "value": "size-uuid-1"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"txn-uuid-1\",\n      \"transactionCode\": \"TXN-001\",\n      \"customerName\": \"John Doe\",\n      \"quantity\": 2,\n      \"tglMulai\": \"2024-02-04T00:00:00Z\",\n      \"tglSelesai\": \"2024-02-07T00:00:00Z\",\n      \"status\": \"active\",\n      \"dateRange\": \"4-7 Feb\",\n      \"displayText\": \"TXN-001 (2 item) untuk 4-7 Feb\",\n      \"daysFromNow\": 2\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"txn-uuid-2\",\n      \"transactionCode\": \"TXN-002\",\n      \"customerName\": \"Jane Smith\",\n      \"quantity\": 1,\n      \"tglMulai\": \"2024-02-10T00:00:00Z\",\n      \"tglSelesai\": \"2024-02-13T00:00:00Z\",\n      \"status\": \"diambil\",\n      \"dateRange\": \"10-13 Feb\",\n      \"displayText\": \"TXN-002 (1 item) untuk 10-13 Feb\",\n      \"daysFromNow\": 8\n    }\n  ],\n  \"cached\": false,\n  \"metadata\": {\n    \"productSizeId\": \"size-uuid-1\",\n    \"statuses\": [\"active\", \"diambil\"],\n    \"limit\": 50,\n    \"sortBy\": \"date_proximity\",\n    \"totalResults\": 2,\n    \"cacheExpiresAt\": \"2024-02-02T10:05:00Z\",\n    \"serviceUsed\": \"ItemHistoryService\"\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Product History - Custom Parameters",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/kasir/transaksi/product-history?productSizeId={{productSizeId}}&statuses=active&limit=10&sortBy=date_desc",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "kasir", "transaksi", "product-history"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "productSizeId",
                  "value": "{{productSizeId}}",
                  "description": "REQUIRED: ID dari product size"
                },
                {
                  "key": "statuses",
                  "value": "active",
                  "description": "Filter by status: 'active', 'diambil', atau 'active,diambil' (comma-separated)"
                },
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "10",
                  "description": "Limit jumlah results (default: 50)"
                },
                {
                  "key": "sortBy",
                  "value": "date_desc",
                  "description": "Sort order: 'date_proximity', 'date_asc', 'date_desc'"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Mendapatkan transaction history dengan custom filtering dan sorting parameters.\n\n🔧 CUSTOM PARAMETERS:\n• statuses: Filter specific status (active only dalam contoh ini)\n• limit: Batasi jumlah results untuk performance\n• sortBy: date_desc untuk newest first\n\n📋 USE CASES:\n• Lihat hanya active bookings\n• Limit results untuk quick preview\n• Sort by newest transactions first"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Product History - Multiple Statuses",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/kasir/transaksi/product-history?productSizeId={{productSizeId}}&statuses=active,diambil&sortBy=date_asc",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "kasir", "transaksi", "product-history"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "productSizeId",
                  "value": "{{productSizeId}}",
                  "description": "REQUIRED: ID dari product size"
                },
                {
                  "key": "statuses",
                  "value": "active,diambil",
                  "description": "Multiple statuses separated by comma"
                },
                {
                  "key": "sortBy",
                  "value": "date_asc",
                  "description": "Sort by date ascending (oldest first)"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Test multiple status filtering dengan comma-separated values.\n\n🔧 MULTIPLE STATUS FILTERING:\n• statuses: 'active,diambil' untuk both status\n• Useful untuk comprehensive view\n• sortBy: date_asc untuk chronological order\n\n📋 BUSINESS LOGIC:\n• Hanya 'active' dan 'diambil' yang supported\n• 'selesai' dan 'cancelled' tidak ditampilkan\n• Invalid statuses akan di-filter out"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
