                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "5",
                  "description": "Same parameters untuk cache key match"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Test cache hit scenario - repeat request dengan same parameters.\n\n🔧 CACHE HIT TESTING:\n• Repeat request dalam 5 minutes\n• Response: cached: true\n• Data served from memory cache\n• Performance: Much faster response time\n\n📋 EXPECTED BEHAVIOR:\n• cached: true dalam response\n• cachedAt: Timestamp when cache was set\n• Same data as previous request\n• Faster response time (<50ms typical)"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Test Different Cache Key",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/kasir/transaksi/product-history?productSizeId={{productSizeId}}&limit=10&sortBy=date_desc",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "kasir", "transaksi", "product-history"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "productSizeId",
                  "value": "{{productSizeId}}",
                  "description": "Same product size ID"
                },
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "10",
                  "description": "Different limit untuk different cache key"
                },
                {
                  "key": "sortBy",
                  "value": "date_desc",
                  "description": "Different sortBy untuk different cache key"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Test different cache key generation dengan different parameters.\n\n🔧 CACHE KEY TESTING:\n• Same productSizeId but different parameters\n• Should generate different cache key\n• Result: cache miss (fresh database query)\n\n📋 CACHE KEY FORMAT:\n• Key: `${productSizeId}:${JSON.stringify({ statuses, limit, sortBy })}`\n• Different parameters = different cache entry\n• Each combination cached separately"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
